<div id="article_show_text"><div>We have moved forums!</div><div><br></div><div>In the loving and collaborative spirit of open-source, we decided to migrate from our old phpBB forum to our new home:</div><div><a href="https://discuss.pixls.us/c/software/rawtherapee" title="">http://rawtherapee.com/forum</a></div><div>This brings you and us closer to the users and developers of other libre graphics software.</div><div><br></div><div>Newcomers will settle right in, just be sure to first read&nbsp;<a href="https://discuss.pixls.us/t/welcome-to-the-rawtherapee-forum-read-this-first/473" target="_blank" title="">this introductory post</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>Users of the old forum will want to start by reading&nbsp;<a href="https://discuss.pixls.us/t/welcome-to-the-new-forum-backup-posts-from-your-old-forum/694" target="_blank" title="">this post</a>&nbsp;which explains how you can access the old forum and what will happen with it.</div><div><br></div><div>Be positive, be respectful, be helpful, have fun!</div></div>

